    "_comment": "Execution data is NOT retained on success. n8n stores its own state in SQLite on an Azure Files SMB share, which corrupted on 2026-08-28 and took the chatbot offline. This workflow is the heaviest writer when the queue is not empty - it carries downloaded PDFs, page images and OCR text through 48 nodes. Failed runs are still saved in full, and errorWorkflow is unaffected, so fc_kb_errors logging is unchanged. If ingestion ever stalls with files stuck short of 'done', suspect this first: Wait For Quota Window defers for 65 seconds, and a deferred run has to survive on persisted state.",
